WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.950
Today I'm tending to the shop.

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.910
By being here, I get a sense of
the type of books that everyone likes.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:11.080
This manga is really awesome!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.410
Is that so?

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.870
Akari only reads manga.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.450
Is this month's issue out yet?

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.750
It just came in.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:24.830
Koyomi is a regular who always buys monthly literary
magazines and novels from her favorite authors.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.910
We can pay with a gift card, right?

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:28.750
Yes.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.370
Seki-senpai tends to buy only
new releases or research journals.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.700
This please.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.910
Thanks for your patronage.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.500
Nanami-senpai prefers study guides and pop fiction.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:40.160
Garden
of Lilies

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.160
FILM ADAPTATION
IN THE WORKS!

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.040
Garden
of Lilies

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.580
This book...

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:48.580
It looks like a generic boy-meets-girl story,
but halfway through it turns into a lesbian romance.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.790
And I heard there are some pretty raunchy scenes...

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.450
The fact that she came all the way here to buy
this book while I'm at the register means...

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.750
She's watching to see how I react.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.120
Is there a problem?

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.330
N-no...

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.450
Would you like a cover for it?

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:08.910
Yes, please.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.790
If I overreact, I'll just be playing into her hands.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.120
I need to stay calm and focus on the register.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.500
Um, Koito-san?

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:19.000
I swear, I didn't know!

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:23.540
I honestly just wanted to buy a book while you
were there, I didn't have any ulterior motives!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.950
I didn't even know it would be THAT kind of story,
I just heard it was a pretty popular book, so I thought...

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.580
So, she was just totally oblivious.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.540
Midterm
Tests Begin 
Midterm
Tests End

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.580
That's everything, good work everyone.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:11.000
As I mentioned, midterms start next week and
until they are finished the Student Council is on break.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:15.120
We expect your test scores will
not reflect poorly on the Student Council.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.620
That almost sounds like a threat, it's freaking me out.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.000
Midterms already...

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.290
I'm heading out now.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:27.790
Good work today.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.000
Hey, Koito-san.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.660
Are you still going to meet up with Nanami-senpai
while the Student Council is on break?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.250
No way!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.790
Why?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:44.250
I told you, we're not dating!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.580
There you go again.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.450
Jeez, you just won't let it go.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.790
But, Koito-san...

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.750
Now I can tell that you like Nanami-senpai as well.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.700
I definitely think he's wrong.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:15.540
The reason I worry about Senpai is because
she's actually a fragile person on the inside,

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:19.450
and nobody else knows that fact about her.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.750
To put it simply, I would say I'm just good-natured.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:32.410
Even if this didn't involve Nanami-senpai,
I'd still do the same thing.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.660
So, he must be wrong.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.000
Hey now, Kano.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.500
Ah! I'm sorry!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.700
I'm putting that last part on the midterm test.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.950
Koyomi usually never sleeps in class.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.700
I've never seen her like this.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:50.870
Koyomi!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:51.620
Huh?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.700
We have to go to the Science Room next.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:57.540
Our teach is super strict, so you'll never
hear the end of it if you end up late!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.120
Yuu, wait up!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:04.750
What?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.370
I'm going on ahead.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.870
I want you to read this and tell me what you think.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.580
What is this?

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.910
Hanazawa Publishing
Amateur Contest Entry 
Title Undecided

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:18.950
A novel?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.910
Did you write this yourself?

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.120
That's why I'm so tired.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:30.750
I know you're a big fan of novels,
but I didn't know you were writing your own!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.000
Because I didn't tell you.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.580
Why?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.290
I didn't want to tell anyone.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:39.700
Why are you always such a vault of secrets?
You know you can trust me.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:43.040
It's really embarrassing, so I kept it
to myself while I was writing.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.910
But I'm going to submit it to a contest
for amateurs and I want to get feedback on it first.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.370
You want feedback from me?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:53.790
I know you read a lot of books, so don't hold back on
any criticism and let me know what you think.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.660
Okay.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:06:00.120
Well, it's pretty long, so it's okay
if you only end up reading half of it.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.580
I'll read it! I'll go through every page
and then get back to you.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.580
Thanks.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:08.870
Oh, shoot!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.500
Oh, are you in a hurry to get it back?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.830
It's okay if you want to wait until after midterms are over.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.700
I'm just giving it to you now because I finally finished it.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:19.950
Got it.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:21.950
Let's hurry!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:22.830
Right.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.290
A novel, huh?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:31.410
If she's submitting it to a contest,
then she must be serious about becoming a writer.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:37.700
She already knows what she wants to be.
Koyomi sure is amazing.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.200
No, no, I can't let myself get distracted now.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.700
What's wrong?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.790
Huh? Ah, sorry.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:54.200
I need to focus on what I can do right now, and
that means being ready for the upcoming midterms.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:59.200
Hey, I was thinking about studying for the midterms
after school. Will you come to the library with me?

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:04.200
We have a whole week before the tests.
If I study now, I'll just forget everything!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.200
Oh boy, I forgot Akari isn't the type to study.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.700
I'm going home to sleep.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.330
No surprise there.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:15.000
I guess I'll just have to go by myself.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.290
Maki-kun.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.540
Heading home?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.540
Yeah, how about you?

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.700
I'm going to the library to do some studying for the test.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:32.700
Would you care to join me?
I don't think I can stay focused on my own.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.080
Oh, really?

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:37.500
Well, I do have some time to spare...

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.830
...but actually, I'm going to have to pass for today.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.540
See you later, Koito-san.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.370
Huh? Oh, okay.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.660
Don't tell me, you're also going to the library?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.580
Check out today and return on:
June 2nd

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:14.410
I'm glad I found someone to come
with me to the library, but...

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.580
...this is making me a little nervous.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.620
Ah, don't think about it.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.000
Have to stay focused.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.620
Let's see...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.830
What are you struggling with?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.450
Huh?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.410
Oh, there are just some math equations
that I don't understand.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.410
I see, if you're having trouble here
then take this formula and...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:57.580
First you need to write it out like this,
and then plug the numbers in.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.580
Oh, I get it! Thanks very much.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.750
You're quite welcome.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.250
Thank you for your help today.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:21.330
I mean, you spent so much time tutoring me that you
didn't have a chance to study for yourself.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.540
Not at all, tutoring is a great way to practice what
I've studied.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.040
But what's going to be on your test is totally
different from mine, you must know that already.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.830
Then just consider it a small token of my affection.

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.080
That's not going to work.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:41.790
It isn't?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.830
To be honest, it really bugs me when
I can't return a favor to someone.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:51.660
Well, I chose to help you because it's what
I wanted to do, you'll just have to get used to it.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.910
"Get used to it"?

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.080
Let's study together again tomorrow.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.370
Okay, sure.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.790
I...

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:18.040
I would have been happy with anyone who agreed to
study with me, it didn't have to be Nanami-senpai.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.200
I didn't choose her.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.080
I didn't get flustered or excited, either.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.790
Oh, that's right. How about you join us, Touko?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:36.870
I'll pass, sorry.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:37.540
Too bad.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:38.330
Bye then.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.120
But...

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.500
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.620
Are you sure about this? It sounded
like they invited you to something.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.160
It's fine, I'm sure.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.160
I want to stay with you.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.950
But I have to admit, I don't hate being chosen like this.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.410
Although, I would probably feel
the same regardless of who chose me.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:14.580
But for right now, she's the one
who wants to spend time with me.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:17.910
See you tomorrow.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.080
Yeah.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.290
Having a relationship like this might be a good thing.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:33.200
It always gets really crowded like this around test time.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.620
It doesn't look like there are any
open seats next to each other.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.750
What should we do?

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:47.080
If I really believe that, then I should start getting
used to being around her more often.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.620
Um, Senpai?

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.120
Huh?

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.000
Shall we go to my place?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:03.950
The Problem with Choices

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:09.040
The Problem with Choices (continued)

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.830
Senpai, you've been oddly quiet for a while now.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.200
R-really?

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.540
I'm home.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.830
E-excuse me.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:25.500
Oh, come on in.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.250
Good afternoon.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.950
I hear you're doing wonderful things
as Student Council President.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.410
No, not at all.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.620
Please come upstairs.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.040
Something smells good.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.700
I'm home.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:44.250
Welcome back.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.950
Yuu-chan, hey there.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.660
Oh, Hiro-kun, nice to see you.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.330
Huh? A guest?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.870
Pardon the intrusion.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.330
Can you handle my chores tonight?

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:57.910
Sure thing. We made some cheesecake,
so feel free to take some with you.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:00.000
Wow! Thanks!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:04.080
Yuu's friend? She's very pretty.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:08.910
She must be from the student council.
Yuu mentioned one of her senpai was really gorgeous.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.790
They seem to be getting along.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:15.330
Yeah, she even gave Yuu a nice souvenir recently.
Some kind of planetarium thing.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:18.620
Oh? That sounds like a pretty expensive souvenir.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.660
Maybe Yuu is her girlfriend or something.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.830
You're joking. Right?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.500
Here we are.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.870
I'll go put on some tea, so please wait.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.870
Y-you don't have to do that.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.450
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.370
Wow, did your sister make those?

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.700
Yeah, you came at a good time.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:43.500
When Hiro-kun visits she usually
makes something sweet to share.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.620
Let's eat up before we get to studying.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:47.410
Sure.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:51.910
Delicious!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.620
Rei-cha... I mean, my sister will be happy to hear that.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.290
Is this Hiro-kun person your sister's boyfriend?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.500
That's right.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.410
They must be far along in their relationship
if he comes to visit your house.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.750
Well, they've been dating ever since high school.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:10.830
So, there's no problems? Like your dad going,
"I won't let you have my daughter!"

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.160
None of that.

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:18.290
My family is mostly just women, so when
Hiro-kun visits it makes my dad pretty happy.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:21.750
He'll probably stay late to have dinner
with us tonight, too.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.250
What is it?

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:32.750
Nothing, I'm just happy to know more about you.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.580
You don't really talk about yourself often.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.830
I guess that's true.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.080
Oh, shoot.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.830
What's wrong?

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.250
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:59.370
Well, you seem like you're really distracted.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.080
Is there something weird lying around here?

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:07.080
Oh, no. Nothing like that, it's fine.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.750
So, are you feeling sick or something?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.540
Your face is red, is it too hot in here?

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.370
No.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.910
Koito-san, you're too close...

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:30.000
Senpai, I can't believe you.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:35.330
I can't help it! Being in the room of
their crush would make anyone get excited!

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.290
Who's the perv now?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.580
This is perfectly normal!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.790
Staaaaare.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.370
Don't stare at me like that.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.080
Is this really what happens when
you fall in love with someone?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.750
Yes, it is.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.500
My heart feels like it's going to leap out of my chest.

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:12.830
Want to take a listen?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.290
I'm just joking!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.500
Hey! Wait!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.040
It's true. Your heart is beating pretty fast.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.950
So you just felt it through my wrist.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:47.080
I think you should be a little more cautious, Koito-san.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:51.540
You're right. I'll be sure to stay on my guard
while you're around, Senpai.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:59.450
I-I wasn't talking about me! If you act that boldly
in front of other people, you'll catch their eye.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.580
I'm pretty sure you're the only one at school
who pays close attention to me.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:08.080
You can never be sure. Someone else might have
already started to fall in love with you.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.080
No way. It could never happen that fast.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:12.160
For example!

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:15.250
Someone like Maki-kun...

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:16.200
Huh?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.580
You two seem close lately.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:23.950
No, no, no. Maki-kun is definitely not into me,
so you don't have to worry.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:28.910
I mean, he just seems to get a kick out of
giving me a hard time about this relationship.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.200
I can't help it.

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:42.580
You are the only one I want to be with,
but I know you don't feel the same about me.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:52.250
It's true that I don't have any special feelings
that drive me to stay with you.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:59.450
However, the person who seems to need me
the most is you, Nanami-senpai.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.870
I've realized that.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.120
So, if you ask me to stay by your side,
then that's what I'll do.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:15.330
That's precisely the kind of attitude that makes me worry.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.950
But, I also like that about you.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:32.410
Aside from the Student Council, I get the feeling
I'll be spending a lot of time with Nanami-senpai.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.450
And she'll be acting like this around me the whole time.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:37.750
Bye.

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.000
Right, see you tomorrow.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:47.120
Despite that, will my feelings towards her
never change at all?

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.290
I'd hate that.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:00.910
However, the person who seems to need me
the most is you, Nanami-senpai.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.500
I've realized that.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.120
So, if you ask me to stay by your side,
then that's what I'll do.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.790
Oh, going home?

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:18.330
Yes, thanks for having me. Oh, the cake was
very delicious. Thank you so much!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.160
Sure, my pleasure.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.910
Do you make sweets like that often?

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.540
No, lately I haven't had the time.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.450
Yuu always loves it when I make cheesecake though.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.500
Oh, is that so?

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.910
Um, if you don't mind,
could you share that recipe with me?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:35.790
I don't mind, but...

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:40.160
Oh, I can send it to you later
if you give me your contact info.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.040
Sure!

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:45.870
CONTACTS
Rei Koito
Recently Added
Touko Nanami

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.910
Touko Nanami. "Nanami-chan", then?

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.250
Take good care of Yuu for me.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.750
O-of course!

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.790
Here. You wanted the smaller one, right?

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:56.580
Yeah.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:02.830
About this much?

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:04.290
Yeah, thank you.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.540
What's up, Yuu? Want my shrimp?

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.160
That's not what I want.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.450
Well, you can't have Hiro!

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.000
I don't want him, either!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.330
Nobody's going to take me from you.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.830
Of course, they won't.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.830
I have somebody too, you know.

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.250
I'm not alone.

